ccusage — https://github.com/ccusage/ccusage
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Used as a reference (commit 06347d39). The rules for counting each API
response once (src/shared/usage/dedupe.ts and the line checks in
src/shared/usage/parse.ts), the 5-hour block boundaries
(src/shared/usage/aggregate.ts) and the test-only reference model in
tests/ccusage-reference.ts are adapted from ccusage's Claude loader and block
logic. The app does not include or depend on ccusage; the "Verify against
ccusage" button only runs it if you installed it yourself.

